Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:21:32 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 040/119] dt-bindings: input: touchscreen: wacom,w9007a-lt03:
 Add W9019

The W9019 is the EMR digitiser of the Samsung Galaxy Tab Active3
(SM-T570). It speaks the same protocol family as the W9002/W9007A, with
a longer query block and tilt/hover-height reporting.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/wacom,w9007a-lt03.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/wacom,w9007a-lt03.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/wacom,w9007a-lt03.yaml
index 6d1da6a43..ad09bcc5e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/wacom,w9007a-lt03.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/wacom,w9007a-lt03.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
       - wacom,w9002
       - wacom,w9007a-lt03
       - wacom,w9007a-v1
+      - wacom,w9019
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
